<title>UK: TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Nottingham Open men's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) beat Chris Wilkinson (Britain) 7-6 (7-3) 6-4</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Arnaud Boetsche (France) 6-3 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Martin Lee (Britain) 6-1 6-1  </p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat 7-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) 6-2 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada) 6-1 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) beat Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Johan Van Herck (Belgium) 6-3 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>8-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Lionel Roux (Fra) 6-4 6-3 Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat 3-Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil) 6-1 7-5</p>
</text>
